    "details": {
      "notes": {
        "value": "<h2>Yojimbo - Starting Statistics</h2><p>Size Medium; Speed 30 ft.; AC +1 natural armor; Special Qualities: Fire immunity.</p><h3>7th-Level Advancement</h3><p>Size Large; Reach 10 ft; AC +3 natural armor; Attack Large Katana (2d6); Ability Scores Str +4, Dex -2, Con +4</p><h3>Schema Fix Note</h3><p>This file was rebuilt to correct three structural errors present in the originally delivered batch: (1) every embedded item's <code>_key</code> now uses the proper <code>!actors.items!&lt;actorId&gt;.&lt;itemId&gt;</code> format instead of the standalone-compendium-item format <code>!items!&lt;itemId&gt;</code>; (2) every action-bearing item's <code>actions</code> array is now nested inside <code>system.actions</code> rather than sitting as a sibling of <code>system</code>; (3) the actor document itself now has the required top-level <code>_key</code>: <code>!actors!&lt;actorId&gt;</code>.</p>"
      }
